The original [incident page](/kb/incidents/4471) says “one issue, one fix queued.” Its
rendered cause table shows two failures. Treat the prose as a claim and compare it with
the components and the source reports before relying on it.

<Callout>
Split the parser and booking-v3 hint failures into separate engineering tickets. Both
can produce a wrong date, but they take different paths and need different fixes.
